WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.640
Good morning John! Time for a truth bomb.

00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:02.140
 

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:04.480
You and I have had a good

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:04.980
month

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:07.540
