00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:08.500
we could do any of the things that we do

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:10.600
without this community.

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:12.660
Frankly, Nerdfighteria is my biggest inspiration

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:15.780
