00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:19.300
I can just ask on Twitter, and Tumblr, and also Instagram

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:22.600
though Instagram on the internet doesn't show me all the comments

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:25.040
Why? Why?! That's not a complicated feature!

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:26.800
Show more.  Gimme a link.

00:00:26.820 --> 00:00:28.360
That's right, I'm already doing it

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:31.220
I'm taking your suggestions on what I should do in my video today.

00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:33.980
[musical transition]

00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:35.120
That was a good idea.

