00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:18.960
I want a Wonder Woman movie, right?

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:22.960
Like, that needs to exist. Did you know that Joss Whedon wanted to do one,

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:25.280
