00:01:31.160 --> 00:01:32.000
Pretty good, actually.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:34.220
I was all ready to talk about how terrible this was.

00:01:34.220 --> 00:01:34.720
Hm.

00:01:34.720 --> 00:01:37.180
OOOOWWWW!

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:38.540
OOWWW!

