[Musical Transition]

00:01:46.880 --> 00:01:47.580
Ow.

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:48.840
[Musical Transition]

00:01:48.840 --> 00:01:50.840
I deal with stress in two ways,

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:52.260
'cos there are two kinds of stress:

00:01:52.260 --> 00:01:53.780
There's stress that you can take care of

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:55.140
and there's stress that you can't.

00:01:55.140 --> 00:01:58.320
The first one, I take care of it as fast as possible

00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:00.340
because putting it off always makes it worse.

00:02:00.340 --> 00:02:04.340
Things that I can't fix, I think about the fact that I can't fix them. I think about why I can't fix them,

00:02:04.340 --> 00:02:08.960
and I come to terms with the fact that this is a problem that I am not going to overcome

00:02:08.960 --> 00:02:10.340
and the world is not a wish granting factory.

00:02:10.340 --> 00:02:12.360
